What am I?

270
00:15:23,128 --> 00:15:23,828
A riddle?

271
00:15:25,348 --> 00:15:29,588
It's coming from the other side.

272
00:15:30,208 --> 00:15:31,968
I mustn't fear the darkness.

273
00:15:33,828 --> 00:15:37,248
Okay, just a little thing that floods the entire room.

274
00:15:37,608 --> 00:15:38,468
Oh, a sneeze!

275
00:15:38,688 --> 00:15:39,368
Too bad.

276
00:15:39,808 --> 00:15:42,728
I'm a white snake that swallows the sea.

277
00:15:43,008 --> 00:15:43,868
What am I?

278
00:15:43,868 --> 00:15:48,188
Um, a white paintbrush with red paint on it?

279
00:15:48,788 --> 00:15:50,068
Too bad.

280
00:15:50,648 --> 00:15:52,188
Here's the last one.

281
00:15:52,568 --> 00:15:55,208
I become shorter the longer I stand.

282
00:15:55,568 --> 00:15:56,308
What am I?

283
00:15:57,188 --> 00:16:00,668
So you're like a flower, right?

284
00:16:00,788 --> 00:16:01,748
Too bad.

285
00:16:02,068 --> 00:16:03,068
But congratulations.

286
00:16:03,708 --> 00:16:06,048
The person you're looking for is here.

287
00:16:06,108 --> 00:16:06,428
What, Muto?

288
00:16:06,788 --> 00:16:07,968
Give him back!

289
00:16:08,248 --> 00:16:08,608
No.

290
00:16:10,068 --> 00:16:12,208
You also are to stay here.

291
00:16:12,208 --> 00:16:13,688
I can't do that!

292
00:16:13,688 --> 00:16:14,748
You'll be fine.

293
00:16:15,048 --> 00:16:15,688
I'm here.

294
00:16:15,968 --> 00:16:17,588
Who are you?

295
00:16:17,908 --> 00:16:19,448
Oh, dear, oh, dear.

296
00:16:19,568 --> 00:16:23,228
Are you to become a prisoner of the darkness now and forever?

297
00:16:23,548 --> 00:16:27,728
Or will you be able to rekindle your radiance, Princess Tutu?

298
00:16:27,728 --> 00:16:45,528
Are you there?

299
00:16:45,528 --> 00:16:48,328
Who are you?

300
00:16:48,328 --> 00:16:50,328
I am Princess Tutu.

301
00:16:50,328 --> 00:16:51,328
I am Princess Tutu.

302
00:16:51,328 --> 00:16:52,448
You're wonderful.

303
00:16:53,088 --> 00:16:54,588
Please stay and dance.

304
00:16:55,048 --> 00:16:57,508
I'll illuminate you for the rest of your life.

305
00:16:58,708 --> 00:16:59,508
Illuminate me?

306
00:16:59,988 --> 00:17:00,628
That's right.

307
00:17:00,688 --> 00:17:01,548
So that's it.

308
00:17:01,628 --> 00:17:05,148
The little thing that floods the entire room is the light of a lamp, then.

309
00:17:05,568 --> 00:17:11,628
And the white snake with the red head that swallows the sea and becomes shorter the longer it stands is the lamp's wick.

310
00:17:11,628 --> 00:17:13,888
You're a lamp, am I right?

311
00:17:14,508 --> 00:17:15,728
You are correct.

312
00:17:21,348 --> 00:17:24,008
Now please give back Muto and his heart.

313
00:17:24,368 --> 00:17:24,688
No.

314
00:17:24,688 --> 00:17:37,528
Idiot.

315
00:17:37,528 --> 00:17:40,908
Please dance with me.

316
00:17:41,408 --> 00:17:42,268
Dance with you?

317
00:17:42,748 --> 00:17:43,228
Yes.

318
00:17:46,508 --> 00:17:47,848
You dance.

319
00:17:48,208 --> 00:17:49,648
I will light your steps.

320
00:17:54,688 --> 00:18:11,848
Your light is so warm and gentle.

321
00:18:12,448 --> 00:18:13,768
Why are you doing this?

322
00:18:14,068 --> 00:18:15,108
What do you want?

323
00:18:16,388 --> 00:18:17,348
My one wish.

324
00:18:17,528 --> 00:18:20,188
My only wish is to keep on shining for someone.

325
00:18:20,968 --> 00:18:23,948
I want to envelop them tenderly in warm light.

326
00:18:23,948 --> 00:18:25,728
Wanting to shine for someone.

327
00:18:26,208 --> 00:18:26,988
That was all.

328
00:18:27,208 --> 00:18:28,868
I didn't want anything else.

329
00:18:29,268 --> 00:18:32,568
And yet, somewhere along the way, I had simply become forgotten.

330
00:18:33,148 --> 00:18:37,108
The people who are precious to me forgot about me and the light I gave them.

331
00:18:38,368 --> 00:18:38,708
No.

332
00:18:39,188 --> 00:18:41,408
They must not have needed me from the beginning.

333
00:18:42,088 --> 00:18:43,388
That can't be true.

334
00:18:43,628 --> 00:18:45,428
I thought they enjoyed my presence.

335
00:18:45,848 --> 00:18:47,588
But that was only what I believed.

336
00:18:47,788 --> 00:18:49,568
I'm sure that's not true.

337
00:18:49,568 --> 00:18:53,888
But right now, there is someone who wants my light.

338
00:18:56,608 --> 00:18:57,168
Muto.

339
00:18:59,888 --> 00:19:01,608
Is that what you want?

340
00:19:01,688 --> 00:19:02,668
To shut him away?

341
00:19:03,828 --> 00:19:04,348
Yes.

342
00:19:04,348 --> 00:19:09,988
I will stay here and illuminate him for all time.

343
00:19:09,988 --> 00:19:14,288
Please, remember what it was like to have your warm light shine on the people you love.

344
00:19:14,288 --> 00:19:20,028
I haven't forgotten.

345
00:19:20,668 --> 00:19:21,768
Then you should know.

346
00:19:22,628 --> 00:19:25,728
Forcing your warmth on people won't bring joy to anyone.

347
00:19:25,728 --> 00:19:30,708
I love the soft and tender glow of your warm light.

348
00:19:31,208 --> 00:19:36,988
I believe that the people who were precious to you were very happy to have you envelop them with that glow.

349
00:19:38,448 --> 00:19:40,928
It's sad that they no longer need you.

350
00:19:41,188 --> 00:19:43,128
But it's something that can't be helped.

351
00:19:43,888 --> 00:19:47,088
Because it isn't something that you can force on people.

352
00:19:47,088 --> 00:19:52,848
If you want what is best for Muto, return his heart.

353
00:19:53,168 --> 00:19:54,748
That will bring him happiness.

354
00:19:54,948 --> 00:19:55,508
Will it?

355
00:19:55,948 --> 00:19:57,348
It's what I believe.

356
00:20:01,768 --> 00:20:03,088
Princess Tutu.

357
00:20:03,868 --> 00:20:07,468
I want to continue illuminating you.

358
00:20:07,468 --> 00:20:16,888
I am the feeling of affection, shattered and forgotten.

359
00:20:17,668 --> 00:20:19,628
The feeling of affection?

360
00:20:22,328 --> 00:20:24,408
Return to Muto now.

361
00:20:33,408 --> 00:20:34,168
Muto.

362
00:20:34,848 --> 00:20:36,248
Princess Tutu.

363
00:20:36,248 --> 00:20:37,588
You should hurry now.

364
00:20:37,888 --> 00:20:38,148
Huh?

365
00:20:39,528 --> 00:20:41,328
Someone is waiting for you.

366
00:20:46,768 --> 00:20:50,568
I was such a fool for believing what Dax said.

367
00:20:53,048 --> 00:20:53,648
Muto.

368
00:20:55,788 --> 00:20:58,108
The fire festival ended long ago.

369
00:20:58,728 --> 00:20:59,288
Sorry.

370
00:21:00,208 --> 00:21:01,648
Muto, what are you doing?

371
00:21:02,388 --> 00:21:02,768
Muto?

372
00:21:02,768 --> 00:21:05,868
Stop it.

373
00:21:05,868 --> 00:21:07,068
You're acting strange.

374
00:21:08,888 --> 00:21:10,948
This is how it should be.

375
00:21:10,948 --> 00:21:29,708
For such kindness to be in your eyes, it's…

376
00:21:29,708 --> 00:21:31,708
Ryo…

377
00:21:40,948 --> 00:21:52,948
The Prince regained the feeling of happiness, but has it illuminated Duck's unhappiness?

378
00:23:25,237 --> 00:23:28,857
Love? It's really not anything like that with me.

379
00:23:28,857 --> 00:23:33,637
I'm sure she's pursuing a wonderful dream, and chances are she's also in love.

380
00:23:33,777 --> 00:23:35,397
You'll always wake up from a dream.

381
00:23:35,637 --> 00:23:37,377
No, you must wake up.

382
00:23:37,517 --> 00:23:38,177
What's this?

383
00:23:38,417 --> 00:23:38,997
You're trembling.

384
00:23:39,277 --> 00:23:40,917
I'm afraid of Princess Tutu.

385
00:23:41,257 --> 00:23:43,097
I just wanted Mewtwo to smile.

386
00:23:43,417 --> 00:23:44,357
That's all I wanted.

387
00:23:45,177 --> 00:23:47,957
Have I just done something terrible to Mewtwo?

388
00:23:48,217 --> 00:23:51,057
All who love stories gather round.

389
00:23:55,237 --> 00:24:25,217
Thank you.

